Liberation Sans, from the Liberation fonts, is licensed under the SIL Open Font License
version 1.1. The OFL permits embedding the font in software and redistributing it with that
software; it forbids selling the font on its own.

The full licence text ships with the upstream package and is reproduced at
https://openfontlicense.org/.

These two faces are compiled into the kuchnia binary so the scene's metrics do not depend on
what the board's fontconfig happens to resolve - see src/main.cpp and docs/app.md.
